<title>UK: Sole Brent date kept by big trader.</title>
<headline>Sole Brent date kept by big trader.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The sole Brent date turning wet on Wednesday was kept by a Wall Street refiner believed holding three other Brent cargoes.</p>
<p>Traders said JP Morgan kept the Oct 3-5 cargo before the five o'clock deadline.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 4088</p>
</text>
